From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] iommu: qcom: configure MSM8226 MDP context cache routing

With terminate faults enabled, architectural ATOS no longer hangs.
It completes but returns PAR0x0000000280000003 for three mapped IOVAs.
The exact BSP definitions decode F, TF and ATOT set, page level2. This
is a hardware translation timeout result, not a valid physical address.

The BSP non-secure context setup programs ACTLR BPRCOSH/ISH/NSH at
bits28/29/30 to redirect cacheable requests to the L2 slave port. Current
readback is0. Carry the instance-specific ACTLR value and program it
while the context is disabled, including resume after power collapse.
Other instances keep their existing ACTLR state. Do not claim this
repairs memory access until architectural translation matches software.

Link: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_samsung_msm8226/blob/3fa1853ed5d6c3a8ef5a2fda9822705243bbc256/drivers/iommu/msm_iommu-v1.c

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/qcom_iommu.c b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/qcom_iommu.c
index 4759f9798..c0f619611 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/qcom_iommu.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/qcom_iommu.c
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ struct qcom_iommu_bfb_reg {
 struct qcom_iommu_cfg {
 	/* Faulting transactions must terminate rather than stall. */
 	bool no_stall;
+	u32 actlr;
 	const struct qcom_iommu_bfb_reg *bfb;
 	unsigned int num_bfb;
 };
@@ -264,6 +265,9 @@ static void qcom_iommu_program_ctx(struct qcom_iommu_dev *qcom_iommu,
 	iommu_writel(ctx, ARM_SMMU_CB_FAR, 0);
 	iommu_writel(ctx, ARM_SMMU_CB_FSR, ARM_SMMU_CB_FSR_FAULT);
 
+	if (qcom_iommu->cfg && qcom_iommu->cfg->actlr)
+		iommu_writel(ctx, ARM_SMMU_CB_ACTLR, qcom_iommu->cfg->actlr);
+
 	/* TTBRs */
 	iommu_writeq(ctx, ARM_SMMU_CB_TTBR0, ctx->ttbr0);
 	iommu_writeq(ctx, ARM_SMMU_CB_TTBR1, 0);
@@ -1034,6 +1038,8 @@ static const struct qcom_iommu_bfb_reg msm8226_mdp_bfb[] = {
 
 static const struct qcom_iommu_cfg msm8226_mdp_cfg = {
 	.no_stall = true,
+	/* BPRCOSH/ISH/NSH: direct cacheable requests to the L2 slave port. */
+	.actlr = GENMASK(30, 28),
 	.bfb = msm8226_mdp_bfb,
 	.num_bfb = ARRAY_SIZE(msm8226_mdp_bfb),
 };
